   "answer_text": "In September 2026, Tessaway delivered 1,097 loads. Under the official contract definition of on-time delivery, loads that arrived late due to shipper-caused delays are excluded from the measurement (top and bottom), leaving 1,059 measured loads. Of these, 926 loads arrived on time, resulting in an official on-time delivery rate of 87.4409820585458% (or 87.44%).\n\nANSWER: 87.4409820585458",
